.TH MEMSPY-UI 1 "October 2026" "memspy 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
memspy-ui \- GNOME and KDE indicator and alert viewer for memspyd
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B memspy-ui
.RI [ --background | --version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B memspy-ui
is an unprivileged GTK application. It shows daemon health and retained High and Medium alerts, and emits native notifications only for High alerts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --background
Start the panel indicator without presenting the window.
.TP
.B --version
Print the version.
.SH ACCESS
The current user must belong to the memspy-ui group. Log out and back in after an administrator adds group membership. GNOME must have its standard AppIndicator support enabled for the panel icon. KDE Plasma uses its built-in StatusNotifier support. The normal application window remains usable without a panel icon.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR memspyd (8)
